 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting Crap': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Endor, Operational As Planned, Death Star II, Moff Jerjerrod; these count toward the 60. Operational As Planned is the starting Interrupt (it takes Death Star II, Jerjerrod and any Effect into hand).",
  "The starting line 'One Effect of MY choice' is not a separate card: it is the Effect Operational As Planned fetches from the list (the strategy says the default is Mobilization Points). The list totals 60 without it, so it is dropped and starting Effect is left empty.",
  "Section headers ('Starting Crap', 'Localities', 'Peepul', 'Destroyers and support ships', 'Walkers', 'Balls', 'Orders and Events', 'Green', 'Red With Green Circles', 'Totally Red') were mis-parsed by the machine draft as cards and are dropped.",
  "Endor, Endor: Bunker and Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) dested the Dark pages; 'Death Star 2' dested the Death Star II system; 'Darth Maul' the Tatooine Darth Maul.",
  "Posted 'Hell 2 Pay' dested There'll Be Hell To Pay; 'Lateralus Damage' Lateral Damage; '1st Strike' First Strike; 'YCHF' You Cannot Hide Forever; 'Mobil Points' Mobilization Points; 'That Thingz Operational' That Thing's Operational; 'We In Attack Position Now' We're In Attack Position Now; 'Sebulba type Podracer' Sebulba's Podracer; 'GADM. Trawn' Grand Admiral Thrawn; 'Bossk In Hounds Ass' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Zuckass in Mist Hunta' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
  "Secret Plans and Oppressive Enforcement were Effects in 2001, not Defensive Shields."
